        "original_id": "bb985304-245c-5f67-9a47-668b1cdf266c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brian Burton, Danger Mouse, James Mercer, John Power, Peter Wilkinson, Jacob Gentry\n- Bands: Broken Bells, The Shins, Cast, The La's, Shack\n- Places: Liverpool\n- Works: My Super Psycho Sweet 16 trilogy, short films\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, Cast was formed in Liverpool as an English rock band by John Power and Peter Wilkinson after John Power left The La's and Shack had split.\n- Broken Bells is an American indie rock band composed of Brian Burton, who is better known as Danger Mouse, and James Mercer.\n- James Mercer is the lead vocalist and guitarist for the indie rock band The Shins.\n- Jacob Gentry directed the My Super Psycho Sweet 16 trilogy.\n- Jacob Gentry collaborated with Broken Bells on short films based on the band's music.",
